    "¡Qué fresquito!"

# game/story.rpy:4250
translate spanish story_a9fad957:

    # mc "Is October weather always this nice?"
    mc "¿El tiempo de octubre siempre es tan bonito?"

# game/story.rpy:4251
translate spanish story_a4014681:

    # cm "{i}It's not unheard of.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Casi siempre.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4256
translate spanish story_edac0374:

    # "I head to Sayori's house and almost walk in when the door opens."
    "Me dirijo a la casa de Sayori y casi entro cuando se abre la puerta."

# game/story.rpy:4258
translate spanish story_f590eef4:

    # s "Meiji?! What are you doing here?"
    s "¡¿Meiji?! ¿Qué haces aquí?"

# game/story.rpy:4260
translate spanish story_e401dcbe:

    # mc "I was going to wake you up if you were still sleeping, but it looks like you got up earlier."
    mc "Iba a despertarte si seguías dormida, pero parece que te has levantado antes."

# game/story.rpy:4261
translate spanish story_9d58132a:

    # s 5b "Oh, right...sorry, I'm still not used to it, is all."
    s 5b "Ah, sí... perdona, es que aún no me acostumbro, eso es todo."

# game/story.rpy:4263
translate spanish story_70e13838:

    # mc "That's okay."
    mc "No pasa nada."

# game/story.rpy:4264
translate spanish story_657effdb:

    # mc "We still have time though, so let me help you clean up."
    mc "Aunque aún tenemos tiempo, así que déjame ayudarte a arreglarte."

# game/story.rpy:4265
translate spanish story_5a801dd5:

    # "I put my bag down and begin fixing her hair."
    "Dejo mi bolsa y empiezo a arreglarle el pelo."

# game/story.rpy:4266
translate spanish story_bba8f755:

    # mc "Geez, your hair is a mess."
    mc "Vaya, qué desastre tienes el pelo."

# game/story.rpy:4267
translate spanish story_ca861a06:

    # s 5a "Ehehe..."
    s 5a "Je, je..."

# game/story.rpy:4268
translate spanish story_6f09b415:

    # s 4l "You know, it's funny..."
    s 4l "Oye, es gracioso..."

# game/story.rpy:4270
translate spanish story_b7722044:

    # mc "What's funny?"
    mc "¿Qué cosa?"

# game/story.rpy:4271
translate spanish story_5ab99d79:

    # "I continue trying to straighten her hair."
    "Sigo intentando enderezarle el pelo."

# game/story.rpy:4272
translate spanish story_617dfc99:

    # s 1d "It's...weird to have a friend who does these kinds of things with you."
    s 1d "Es... raro tener un amigo que hace este tipo de cosas contigo."

# game/story.rpy:4273
translate spanish story_eff5dfe7:

    # mc "{b}That was earlier than expected.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Eso ha sido antes de lo esperado.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4274
translate spanish story_bd92c395:

    # mc "{b}But then again, this scenario did happen in the game.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Pero por otro lado, este escenario sí que pasó en el juego.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4275
translate spanish story_c196029f:

    # cm "{i}Aaah! Make her stop! This is embarrassing...{/i}"
    cm "{i}¡Ahhh! ¡Hazla parar! Esto es vergonzoso...{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4276
translate spanish story_9b05e0b3:

    # mc "I don't think it's weird at all."
    mc "No creo que sea raro para nada."

# game/story.rpy:4278
translate spanish story_f793efa7:

    # "I reply to both Meiji and Sayori."
    "Respondo tanto a Meiji como a Sayori."

# game/story.rpy:4279
translate spanish story_42ec2cca:

    # mc "Believe it or not, I care about you."
    mc "Lo creas o no, me importas."

# game/story.rpy:4281
translate spanish story_de871864:

    # "I only have moderate success with her hair."
    "Solo tengo un éxito moderado con su pelo."

# game/story.rpy:4282
translate spanish story_4e2b08c3:

    # "I notice some toothpaste stains on her collar. I subtly wipe it off while pretending to straighten her collar."
    "Veo algunas manchas de pasta de dientes en el cuello de su chaqueta. Las limpio sutilmente mientras finjo enderezarle el cuello."

# game/story.rpy:4283
translate spanish story_ce82054c:

    # "I stand back and stroke my chin, looking at her with faux appraisal."
    "Me aparto y me acaricio la barbilla, mirándola con fingida evaluación."

# game/story.rpy:4284
translate spanish story_53135768:

    # mc "That's good."
    mc "Muy bien."

# game/story.rpy:4285
translate spanish story_7c914ea7:

    # mc "Hey Sayori...I've always wondered..."
    mc "Oye, Sayori... siempre me he preguntado..."

# game/story.rpy:4287
translate spanish story_fe82e288:

    # mc "Why do you leave your blazer unbuttoned?"
    mc "¿Por qué dejas la chaqueta desabrochada?"

# game/story.rpy:4288
translate spanish story_1353a4c1:

    # s 5c "I'm not telling you."
    s 5c "No te lo diré."

# game/story.rpy:4289
translate spanish story_60ccb8a8:

    # cm "{i}Button it up for her.{/i}"
    cm "{i}Abrochásela.{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4290
translate spanish story_689b167d:

    # mc "{b}Trust me on this, it's better if we don't.{/b}"
    mc "{b}Confía en mí, es mejor que no lo hagamos.{/b}"

# game/story.rpy:4291
translate spanish story_c9d973c2:

    # mc "Well, I guess I've gotten so used to seeing you in that blazer that it would be weird to see it buttoned up."
    mc "Bueno, supongo que me he acostumbrado tanto a verte con esa chaqueta que sería raro verla abrochada."

# game/story.rpy:4293
translate spanish story_d90d5a2e:

    # mc "But it does look a bit small on you."
    mc "Pero sí que te queda un poco pequeña."

# game/story.rpy:4294
translate spanish story_0b182316:

    # "I tug on the sleeves."
    "Tiro de las mangas."

# game/story.rpy:4295
translate spanish story_ebd72540:

    # mc "Couldn't you at least get a bigger one so it covers your arms? It's getting colder, you know."
    mc "¿No podrías al menos conseguir una más grande para que te cubra los brazos? Hace más frío, ¿sabes?"

# game/story.rpy:4296
translate spanish story_c2841920:

    # s 2h "But I have my coat."
    s 2h "Pero tengo mi abrigo."

# game/story.rpy:4298
translate spanish story_f478f7d3:

    # mc "I guess so, but you'd look a lot prettier with a properly fitting blazer."
    mc "Supongo que sí, pero te verías mucho más guapa con una chaqueta que te quedara bien."

# game/story.rpy:4300
translate spanish story_d790cefd:

    # "I feel Meiji get super embarrassed."
    "Siento a Meiji ponerse muy rojo."

# game/story.rpy:4302
translate spanish story_ee85568a:

    # s "Y-You think I would...?"
    s "¿T-Tú crees eso...?"

# game/story.rpy:4303
translate spanish story_97aac5d6:

    # cm "{i}I would never say that! I'd think it!{/i}"
    cm "{i}¡Nunca diría eso! ¡Lo pensaría!{/i}"

# game/story.rpy:4304
translate spanish story_6379be18:

    # mc "I do think that."
    mc "Sí, lo pienso."

# game/story.rpy:4305
translate spanish story_83fa40f8:

    # s 1a "So if I keep it unbuttoned then I won't get a boyfriend, right?"
    s 1a "Así que si lo dejo desabrochado no tendré novio, ¿verdad?"

# game/story.rpy:4306
translate spanish story_6973fd9b:

    # mc "Um...I never mentioned a boyfriend, did I?"
    mc "Mmm... ¿acaso mencioné un novio?"

# game/story.rpy:4307
translate spanish story_9a3ea452:

    # s 5a "Ehehe, well..."
    s 5a "Je, je, bueno..."

# game/story.rpy:4308
translate spanish story_a1397ff1:

    # mc "Maybe I implied it a bit."
    mc "Quizás lo insinué un poco."

# game/story.rpy:4309
translate spanish story_576db901:

    # s 1y "Ehehe...maybe I misheard you."
    s 1y "Je, je... quizás no te he oído bien."

# game/story.rpy:4310
translate spanish story_e78487b3:

    # mc "Maybe so."
    mc "Puede que sí."

# game/story.rpy:4311
translate spanish story_63ebe93b:

    # "Okay...that was odd. Well, I'll try and keep an eye on that."
    "Vale... eso ha sido raro. Bueno, intentaré estar atento a eso."

# game/story.rpy:4313
translate spanish story_3d1c7969:

    # mc "To answer your question, though, I think that if a guy is telling you not to dress how you like, then he's not worth your time."
    mc "Pero para responder a tu pregunta, creo que si un chico te dice que no te vistas como te gusta, entonces no merece tu tiempo."

# game/story.rpy:4314
translate spanish story_514d06a4:

    # mc "I've never had a girlfriend myself, but if I did and she tried to change the way I dress to suit her tastes, I'd dump her so hard."
    mc "Yo nunca he tenido novia, pero si la tuviera y ella intentara cambiar mi forma de vestir para que le gustara, la dejaría sin más."

# game/story.rpy:4315
translate spanish story_8e253cd3:

    # mc "It's not like you've been scolded by the teachers, and I don't think leaving the blazer loose is against any school dress codes."
    mc "No es como si te hubieran regañado los profesores, y no creo que dejar la chaqueta suelta vaya en contra de ningún código de vestimenta del instituto."

# game/story.rpy:4316
translate spanish story_bc980dd7:

    # s 2x "You think so?"
    s 2x "¿Lo crees?"

# game/story.rpy:4318
translate spanish story_2f068911:

    # mc "I do."
    mc "Sí."

# game/story.rpy:4320
translate spanish story_500fbbcd:

    # mc "I know if it were me, if we started dating, I wouldn't say anything negative about your blazer."
    mc "Sé que si fuera yo, si empezáramos a salir, no diría nada negativo sobre tu chaqueta."

# game/story.rpy:4321
translate spanish story_8f2d012f:

    # mc "If you didn't, not only would you be harder to find, but it's such a Sayori thing for you to do."
    mc "Si no la dejaras suelta, no solo sería más difícil encontrarte, sino que además es algo tan propio de ti."

# game/story.rpy:4322
translate spanish story_2dbae66c:

    # s 5c "Meanie..."
    s 5c "Malo..."

# game/story.rpy:4323
translate spanish story_cecebb28:

    # mc "Sayori, your little idiosyncrasies make you as cute as you are."
    mc "Sayori, tus pequeñas manías te hacen tan mona como eres."

# game/story.rpy:4324
translate spanish story_da248f86:

    # s 4m "Wha...you know what that word means?"
    s 4m "Ehhh... ¿sabes qué significa esa palabra?"

# game/story.rpy:4326
translate spanish story_68211dd8:

    # mc "Now who's being the mean one?"
    mc "¿Y ahora quién es la mala?"

# game/story.rpy:4327
translate spanish story_6f212570:

    # s 5a "Ehehe...sorry."
    s 5a "Je, je... perdona."

# game/story.rpy:4329
translate spanish story_6ccddc4d:

    # mc "It's alright, but we've dawdled enough. We should get going or we're gonna be late."
    mc "No pasa nada, pero ya hemos tardado bastante. Deberíamos irnos o llegaremos tarde."
